{% comment %} Refund & Cancellation Policy {% endcomment %}
<div class="policy-page">
  <h1>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
  <p class="policy-date">Last updated: {{ 'now' | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}</p>

  <h2>Cancellations</h2>
  <p>You may cancel your order <strong>before it is dispatched</strong> by contacting us on WhatsApp or email. Once dispatched, orders cannot be cancelled.</p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>We offer refunds or replacements in the following cases:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Items delivered are damaged, rotten, or of poor quality</li>
    <li>Wrong items delivered</li>
    <li>Order not delivered</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To request a refund, please contact us within <strong>24 hours of delivery</strong> with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your order/invoice number</li>
    <li>Photos of the affected items</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Refund Process</h2>
  <p>Approved refunds are processed within <strong>5–7 business days</strong> to the original payment method. UPI refunds are typically faster (1–2 days).</p>

  <h2>Non-Refundable Cases</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Change of mind after delivery</li>
    <li>Issues reported more than 24 hours after delivery</li>
    <li>Items stored improperly after delivery</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@thegoodpapaya.com">hello@thegoodpapaya.com</a><br>
  We aim to respond within 24 hours.</p>
</div>
